{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790940720, "covers_from": "2026-10-02T11:32:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-02T11:33:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790940780, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-02T11:32:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 28965, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "交通", "content": "行人道常常遇到電線桿和變電箱，使輪椅族和嬰兒車需要到馬路上才能前進。\n建案施工圍的暫時行人道無法行走", "display_name": "北投代表 Yuhui", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-02T11:32:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 28888, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "環境", "content": "請不要再砍樹了。城市充滿綠色是台北市最吸引歐美人士的特色。", "display_name": "大同代表 No.28,888", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-02T11:32:24+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 4635, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "環境", "content": "樹木越來越少，希望把樹種回來！", "display_name": "士林代表 No.4,635", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-02T11:32:29+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 45348, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "希望有關道路的工程，如挖馬路、拓寬水溝、鋪柏油等，施工能避開上下班與假日，台北市真的夠塞了，放過我們", "display_name": "大安代表 Daniel Liu", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-02T11:32:44+00:00", "duration_seconds": 16, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 2441, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "其他", "content": "公車站沒有垃圾桶有夠不方便的啦", "display_name": "大安代表 No.2,441", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 28888, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 No.28,888", "district": "datong", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 4635, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.4,635", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}